{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE 8IGHT is a 3D first-person psychological horror/story game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will step into the shoes of Max, a protagonist suffering from schizophrenia, and uncover hidden truths while enduring the torment of hallucinations and delusions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ultimately, you will decide his fate.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The origin of the recurring nightmares</strong>, <strong>the cause of his schizophrenia</strong>, and the secrets buried within it all\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Was it really just schizophrenia causing these psychological symptoms (hallucinations and delusions)?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to break free from his nightmarish fate, Max starts to move within his home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And first, he must find the medication</strong> that can alleviate his symptoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perhaps that medication might hold the key to solving everything... but who knows?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Play Time]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The average play time is approximately <strong>2 hours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b However, it may vary depending on play style, story interpretation, and number of endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Schizophrenia]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras/d1e0fb49c658fafeb8e8ee1acf56aa16.avif?t=1743571322\" width=800 height=526 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily experienced from the perspective of Max, the protagonist suffering from schizophrenia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As such, various elements are designed to enhance immersion, such as objects moving abnormally or locations suddenly changing\u2014representing the mental state of a protagonist living with schizophrenia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Story]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras/1081de2e16618ecc8e58fe8fe0e8c208.avif?t=1743571322\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras_big/1081de2e16618ecc8e58fe8fe0e8c208.avif?t=1743571322 width=800 height=486 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, players gradually uncover the hidden story of Max.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the secrets of Max as he faces a nightmare-like fate amidst a psychologically dark atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Intuitive Puzzles]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras/72324de5e08ad6ef2e209c7781fa14f1.avif?t=1743571322\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras_big/72324de5e08ad6ef2e209c7781fa14f1.avif?t=1743571322 width=800 height=442 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To enhance the gameplay experience and help players better understand the story, intuitive puzzle elements are scattered throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles using the provided hints to advance through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Multiple Endings]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras/6eb3029cafea8317a71ccf8008fbb7e8.avif?t=1743571322\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras_big/6eb3029cafea8317a71ccf8008fbb7e8.avif?t=1743571322 width=800 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's ending varies depending on the choices players make during the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t worry\u2014a save point is always nearby when significant choices arise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There are a total of 4 endings in this game. (A, B-1, B-2, C)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 main endings (A, B, C), with one of them branching into two variations (B-1, B-2).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the multiple endings and see what fate awaits Max.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"082a28782712dffe34653fcb9f713488d8c5bf4a.jpg","localized_name":"The Beginning of the Nightmare","name":"The Beginning of the Nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1316720/082a28782712dffe34653fcb9f713488d8c5bf4a.jpg"},{"icon":"c005300a8bdfea895b245187ad61bfe16c6f875c.jpg","localized_name":"Repeat Playback","name":"Repeat Playback","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1316720/c005300a8bdfea895b245187ad61bfe16c6f875c.jpg"},{"icon":"cc955297f247ab7b0b0f96ad4c5c129287f18906.jpg","localized_name":"Noble Sacrifice","name":"Noble Sacrifice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1316720/cc955297f247ab7b0b0f96ad4c5c129287f18906.jpg"},{"icon":"3d6f67027e9212c0727b34af2579d82630214c92.jpg","localized_name":"Recurring Nightmare","name":"Recurring Nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1316720/3d6f67027e9212c0727b34af2579d82630214c92.jpg"},{"icon":"94bb0c85d7f045c8f3c7e2e79ff4e6f47eb47e63.jpg","localized_name":"End of the Nightmare","name":"End of the Nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/im