lass=\"bb_paragraph\" >As such, various elements are designed to enhance immersion, such as objects moving abnormally or locations suddenly changing\u2014representing the mental state of a protagonist living with schizophrenia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Story]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras/1081de2e16618ecc8e58fe8fe0e8c208.avif?t=1743571322\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras_big/1081de2e16618ecc8e58fe8fe0e8c208.avif?t=1743571322 width=800 height=486 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, players gradually uncover the hidden story of Max.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the secrets of Max as he faces a nightmare-like fate amidst a psychologically dark atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Intuitive Puzzles]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras/72324de5e08ad6ef2e209c7781fa14f1.avif?t=1743571322\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras_big/72324de5e08ad6ef2e209c7781fa14f1.avif?t=1743571322 width=800 height=442 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To enhance the gameplay experience and help players better understand the story, intuitive puzzle elements are scattered throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles using the provided hints to advance through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Multiple Endings]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1316720/extras/6eb3029cafea8317a71ccf